{"unit_id":"apolenkov__dsh-provider-proxy#card-zh","repo":"apolenkov/dsh-provider-proxy","commit":"1102ff4ec8f0820d9206cec5699031a3fde29ea9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-provider-proxy**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供按提供商主机和模型 ID 配置的出站代理路由。它在 DSH 的 LLM 流水线中关联当前提供商与模型，并包装进程级 Undici dispatcher；同时在插件配置页和设置页提供路由编辑界面。主要功能包括按主机匹配请求、按模型精确或前缀匹配、选择继承系统代理/直连/自定义 HTTP(S) 代理，以及为匹配请求添加自定义请求头。适合需要让不同模型或服务走不同代理的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥；使用自定义代理时需自行提供代理地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:20-45","index.js:164-173","core.js:150-240","client/client.js:93-130"]}
{"unit_id":"apolenkov__dsh-provider-proxy#card-en","repo":"apolenkov/dsh-provider-proxy","commit":"1102ff4ec8f0820d9206cec5699031a3fde29ea9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-provider-proxy** (DSH Web plugin): route outbound requests through different proxies by provider host or model ID. It adds matching rules, direct or inherited routing, custom HTTP(S) proxies, request headers, and web settings pages. No API key is required; custom proxy use requires an address.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:20-45","index.js:164-173","core.js:150-240","client/client.js:93-130"]}
