{"unit_id":"apolenkov__dsh-provider-proxy#feature-12","repo":"apolenkov/dsh-provider-proxy","commit":"1102ff4ec8f0820d9206cec5699031a3fde29ea9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-provider-proxy** 的功能「按模型路由」：根据 LLM 请求的提供商和模型 ID 选择代理，可配置精确模型或前缀规则，并支持提供商限定。模型请求以外的流量不会仅因模型规则而匹配。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:164-169","core.js:150-240"]}
{"unit_id":"apolenkov__dsh-provider-proxy#feature-13","repo":"apolenkov/dsh-provider-proxy","commit":"1102ff4ec8f0820d9206cec5699031a3fde29ea9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-provider-proxy** 的功能「按主机路由」：根据出站请求的目标主机匹配提供商规则，为命中的请求选择继承系统代理、直连或自定义 HTTP(S) 代理。未命中时继续使用已有 dispatcher。","source":"generated","evidence":["core.js:150-240","core.js:391-425"]}
{"unit_id":"apolenkov__dsh-provider-proxy#feature-14","repo":"apolenkov/dsh-provider-proxy","commit":"1102ff4ec8f0820d9206cec5699031a3fde29ea9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-provider-proxy** 的功能「请求头注入」：为匹配的代理规则添加配置的 HTTP 请求头；值中的 {{opencodeSession}} 会在分发时替换为新生成的会话格式 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["core/headers.js:93-114","core.js:150-240"]}
{"unit_id":"apolenkov__dsh-provider-proxy#feature-15","repo":"apolenkov/dsh-provider-proxy","commit":"1102ff4ec8f0820d9206cec5699031a3fde29ea9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-provider-proxy** 的功能「网页路由配置」：在插件管理配置页和独立设置区域编辑默认路由、提供商主机规则及模型规则，表单保存时提交带版本的配置变更。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:104-130","client/client.ui.js:90-150"]}
{"unit_id":"apolenkov__dsh-provider-proxy#feature-16","repo":"apolenkov/dsh-provider-proxy","commit":"1102ff4ec8f0820d9206cec5699031a3fde29ea9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-provider-proxy** 的功能「应用状态记录」：插件将最近一次路由配置应用结果和路由摘要写入状态 JSON 文件，目录可由环境变量覆盖；写入失败不会阻止插件运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:136-160","index.js:191-214"]}
